# Band-mix aux fusion + QK-norm draft attention for the EAGLE-3 drafter.
# Applies on top of 20-vllm-v0.25.0-eagle3-vistoken.patch.
#
# Covers three features that interleave in llama_eagle3.py and can no longer be
# split into independent patches:
#   * banded_mix_fc   -- learned softmax band mix in front of the stock fused_fc
#                        EAGLE-3.1 path; loads band{i}_mix_logits, allows unequal
#                        bands, sizes fc / fc_norm by the band count. Distinct
#                        from the `aux_band_mix` timing-study stub (equal bands,
#                        hard-coded uniform weights, no learned parameters).
#   * banded_mix_wide -- no fusion FC at all: layer 0 takes
#                        [embed | band_0 .. band_{B-1}] = (1+B)H.
#   * qk_norm         -- per-head RMSNorm on Q/K pre-RoPE in the draft attention
#                        (`qk_norm: true`), loading self_attn.q_norm/k_norm.weight.
